  "bodyHash": "b9ca786e82eb9d3f",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#843fa1\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;整合簡易劍</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">目前適用於 (Neo)Forge 1.20.1</span></strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp;作者：</strong> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>Craisinlord</strong></span> </span></span><strong>和 <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">Qwerty97475</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e03e2d\"><strong>[圖片]</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#843fa1\"><strong>什麼是整合簡易劍？<br></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">整合簡易劍（Integrated Simply Swords）是一個 <strong>簡易劍</strong> 的 <strong>模組插件</strong>，旨在當安裝了添加其他武器材質的模組時，<strong>填補</strong>缺失的劍。<br>此外，還計劃為某些特定模組/生態系/概念添加主題化的<strong>獨特武器</strong>。<br><br><strong>它主要是為</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合 Minecraft</a>&nbsp;<strong>整合包設計的，</strong>其中包含的模組更有可能獲得兼容性優先級，<strong>但歡迎你在自己的整合包中使用它！<br><br>也歡迎提出關於模組兼容性的建議</strong>！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#236fa1\"><strong>紋理由 Qwerty97475 製作</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1104/246/image_2025-02-21_184716117.png\" width=\"506\" height=\"690\"></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>必要模組：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易劍 (Simply Swords)</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API<br></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>可選支持的模組：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火：龍 (Ice and Fire: Dragons)</a><br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">洞穴與深淵 (Caverns &amp; Chasms)</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galosphere\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galosphere</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eidolon-repraised\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eidolon: Repraised</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreganized</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born in Chaos</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>計劃支持的模組：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天界 (The Aether)</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">其他類似的簡易劍插件：</span><br></strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knave's Needs<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-compatible\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Swords Modded Compatibility<br></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#843fa1\"><strong>免責聲明</strong></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>整合 Minecraft (Integrated MC)</strong></span></h3>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">整合簡易</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>劍</strong></span></span>的主要功能是為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合 Minecraft</a> 整合包中的模組添加 <strong>簡易劍的模組兼容性</strong>。這意味著來自整合 Minecraft 的模組將獲得<strong>集成優先權</strong>，而非整合包中的模組則次之。</p>\n<p>此外，<strong>整合簡易劍</strong> 可能會進行一些<strong>不反映原版模組</strong>的更改。例如，紋理可能基於資源包而不是模組的原始紋理。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>集成標準</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只有當工具組<strong>符合所有這些標準</strong>時，才會考慮將其集成：<br></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擁有<strong>劍</strong>、<strong>斧</strong>、<strong>鎬</strong>、<strong>鏟</strong>、<strong>鋤</strong>等 - 如果模組作者認為某種工具不需要這些，那麼為其添加簡易劍兼容性可能不是個好主意。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>與整合簡易劍相同的 Minecraft 版本</strong> - 我們不會為了添加更多模組的兼容性而將此模組移植到其他版本。<br></span></span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擁有高品質紋理</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - 我不想為了製作新紋理而使用糟糕的色板，但是如果該模組有<strong>良好的資源包</strong>，則更有可能被考慮。</span></span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">熱門</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組 - 否則，與為更受歡迎的模組添加兼容性相比，花費的時間就不值得了。</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#843fa1\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">支持 Craisin！</span></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>查看我的其他項目！</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合 Minecraft</a>，整合結構系列的官方整合包</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-stronghold\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合要塞 (Integrated Stronghold)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合村莊 (Integrated Villages)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/idas\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合地牢與結構 (IDAS)<br></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Bisect Server Hosting</strong></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraisincraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/988/bh_id_promo.png\" width=\"778\" height=\"115\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我已經花了超過 3 年的時間來創建 Minecraft 模組。我是專門為此學習 Java 的。如果你非常喜歡我的項目，兩種很好的支持我的方式是通過 Patreon 直接支持，或者通過 <strong>Bisect Hosting</strong> 購買你的服務器。點擊上面的圖片獲取服務器，使用我的代碼 <strong>CraisinCraft</strong> 獲得<strong>首月 25% 折扣</strong>，並享受與朋友一起玩遊戲的樂趣！設置非常簡單，幾乎<strong>只需點擊一次</strong>。<br><br></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Patreon</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>點擊下面的圖片</strong>進入我的 <strong>Patreon</strong> 以直接支持我。你將獲得專屬的 <strong>Discord 角色</strong>、聊天權限，並能直接影響我的模組開發。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/craisinlord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/148/digital-patreon-wordmark_fierycoral.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"88\"></a></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Discord</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>加入 Discord</strong>，點擊下方的<strong>圖片或鏈接</strong>，如果你遇到<strong>任何問題</strong>或有<strong>建議</strong>，我會盡力回應每個人，並且非常歡迎建議！<strong>感謝大家遊玩並支持我的模組！</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb<br><br></a></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#800080\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">備註與致謝</span><br></span></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br>特別感謝：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Craisin 的贊助者們</strong>！！！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Qwerty97475</strong> 製作了紋理！！！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Fel</strong> 和 <strong>絕對不是 Darkosto 粉絲</strong> 提供了靈感<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>關於紋理的說明：</strong></span><br></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">冰與火的兼容性紋理基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ice-fire-dragonsteel-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火：龍鋼兵器 (Ice &amp; Fire Dragonsteel Weaponry)</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/frostbiteandbrimstone\" rel=\"nofollow\">寒霜與硫磺 (Frostbite &amp; Brimstone)</a> 的紋理</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">銀器的兼容性紋理基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">洞穴與深淵 (Caverns &amp; Chasms)</a> 的紋理<br><br>所有其他紋理均基於其所支持模組的原始資產。</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
